<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Super Gp details capitalisation award terms.</title>
<headline>Super Gp details capitalisation award terms.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Super Group Ltd said on Monday that shareholders had to be registered in the firm's books on June 13 to qualify for a capitalisation share award.</p>
<p>Shareholders will be entitled to new shares in the ratio that 11.0 cents multiplied by 1.05 bears to the average trading price of Super Group's ordinary shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for the 30 calender days before July 30.</p>
<p>Shareholders can instead elect to receive the 11.0 cents cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
